they'll forget right away...

00:21:50.008 --> 00:21:52.210 line:0%
we're gonna catch an
organic...fresh fish.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.878 line:0%
Who wants a
tall fishing pole?

00:21:53.978 --> 00:21:56.614 line:0%
They'll remember that and
their tummies will remember.

00:21:56.714 --> 00:21:57.782 line:0%
Are you guys hungry?

00:21:57.882 --> 00:22:00.385 line:0%
GRANDKIDS: Yeah!

00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:05.690 line:0%
COLBERT: You feel
something Chelsea?

00:22:05.791 --> 00:22:07.559 line:0%
CHELSEA: I think so yeah...
I felt something.

00:22:07.659 --> 00:22:10.495 line:0%
